+3. Input the obtained low-resolution image and the high-resolution guidance image into the RefSR-CNN [S1].
+4. The RefSR-CNN yields feature maps from the detail-dominant information module and the degradation-dominant information module [S1].
+5. Fuse the two feature maps to reconstruct the high-resolution image [S1].
 
